  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Paul Anthony Novelly, known as Tony, was an American businessman who built his fortune through Apex Oil, a petroleum trading, storage and distribution business. He joined the company as an employee, became an owner and guided it through bankruptcy. His interests also included oil terminals, specialty chemicals, property and a Michigan resort.",
    "confidence": {
